window.KINESICA_GOOGLE_REVIEWS={placeId:"ChIJZ2mPW9K1vJUR3J5kGRi5gws",fetchedAt:"2026-10-27T17:35:43.135Z",displayName:"Kinesica",googleMapsUri:"https://maps.google.com/?cid=829710269522681564&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA",rating:5,userRatingCount:35,reviews:[{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto me ayud\xF3 mucho y saco dolores dorsales y de rodilla que venia padeciendo. El trato muy amigable y profesional. Lo recomiendo completamente!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace una semana",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Muy contenta con la atenci\xF3n. Norberto destaca por su profesionalismo, puntualidad y trato cercano. Me ayud\xF3 mucho con mi recuperaci\xF3n mediante un tratamiento personalizado. Totalmente recomendable si busc\xE1s un especialista de confianza.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 1 mes",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mabel Luj\xE1n",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBfQZpjPw8LN5V7jT-CmJiCzsIWu7SIBXRqourAQTOJvmxQLse=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115447603217467401197/reviews",rating:5,text:"Profesional muy responsable, respetuoso y con una excelente escucha lo cual es un gran valor para la especialidad . Tratamiento muy personalizado con diferentes t\xE9cnicas, acorde a la necesidad de la consulta. Muy satisfecha!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 1 mes",publishTime:"2026-09-01T17:22:51.713761464Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",language:"es"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",language:"es"}],byLang:{es:[{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto me ayud\xF3 mucho y saco dolores dorsales y de rodilla que venia padeciendo. El trato muy amigable y profesional. Lo recomiendo completamente!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace una semana",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Muy contenta con la atenci\xF3n. Norberto destaca por su profesionalismo, puntualidad y trato cercano. Me ayud\xF3 mucho con mi recuperaci\xF3n mediante un tratamiento personalizado. Totalmente recomendable si busc\xE1s un especialista de confianza.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 1 mes",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mabel Luj\xE1n",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBfQZpjPw8LN5V7jT-CmJiCzsIWu7SIBXRqourAQTOJvmxQLse=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115447603217467401197/reviews",rating:5,text:"Profesional muy responsable, respetuoso y con una excelente escucha lo cual es un gran valor para la especialidad . Tratamiento muy personalizado con diferentes t\xE9cnicas, acorde a la necesidad de la consulta. Muy satisfecha!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 1 mes",publishTime:"2026-09-01T17:22:51.713761464Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",language:"es"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",language:"es"}],en:[{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto helped me a lot and relieved the back and knee pain I'd been suffering from. He was very friendly and professional. I highly recommend him!",language:"en",relativeTime:"a week ago",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"I'm very happy with the service. Norberto stands out for his professionalism, punctuality, and friendly approach. He greatly helped my recovery with a personalized treatment plan. I highly recommend him if you're looking for a trustworthy specialist.",language:"en",relativeTime:"a month ago",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"I've been coming here for years, and Norberto's care is excellent. He knows how to listen so he can decide where to focus the work, and he uses a range of techniques according to the patient's needs. I always left feeling better than when I arrived. I recommend him highly!!!!!",language:"en"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incredibly surprised, in a good way: I had epicondylitis pain for 3 years, and after just 2 sessions with kinesiologist Norberto Brude I have no pain, I was able to go back to training, I used to wake up with a numb hand and it hasn't happened again! Truly an outstanding professional, and above all he brought calm when I needed it most.",language:"en"},{author:"Claudia Rothschild",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zjR9a6k2KK0-ciZ60piNXJdtemgzlxd8EAGV2FdBnpfcV7wcWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118351524349714047042/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude is excellent. I've had several problems with my spine, knees, and neck that have caused me constant pain for years. I tried several other professionals, but only with his treatment have I felt considerable relief. I highly recommend him!",language:"en",relativeTime:"3 months ago",publishTime:"2026-07-21T22:41:19.944949311Z"}],fr:[{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto m'a beaucoup aid\xE9 et a soulag\xE9 mes douleurs au dos et au genou. Il \xE9tait tr\xE8s sympathique et professionnel. Je le recommande vivement !",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a une semaine",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Je suis tr\xE8s satisfait du service. Norberto se distingue par son professionnalisme, sa ponctualit\xE9 et sa gentillesse. Il a grandement contribu\xE9 \xE0 ma gu\xE9rison gr\xE2ce \xE0 un plan de traitement personnalis\xE9. Je le recommande vivement si vous recherchez un sp\xE9cialiste de confiance.",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a un mois",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mabel Luj\xE1n",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBfQZpjPw8LN5V7jT-CmJiCzsIWu7SIBXRqourAQTOJvmxQLse=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115447603217467401197/reviews",rating:5,text:"Un professionnel tr\xE8s responsable et respectueux, dot\xE9 d'une excellente capacit\xE9 d'\xE9coute, un atout pr\xE9cieux dans cette sp\xE9cialit\xE9. Le traitement est tr\xE8s personnalis\xE9 et utilise diff\xE9rentes techniques adapt\xE9es aux besoins de chaque patient. J'en suis tr\xE8s satisfait\xA0!",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a un mois",publishTime:"2026-09-01T17:22:51.713761464Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Je viens le consulter depuis des ann\xE9es, et l'accompagnement de Norberto est excellent. Il sait \xE9couter pour d\xE9terminer sur quels points concentrer le travail, et il ma\xEEtrise diverses techniques qu'il utilise selon les besoins du patient. Je suis toujours sortie de la s\xE9ance mieux qu'\xE0 l'arriv\xE9e. Je le recommande vivement !!!!!",language:"fr"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Agr\xE9ablement surpris, au-del\xE0 de toute attente : je souffrais d'une \xE9picondylite depuis 3 ans, et en \xE0 peine 2 s\xE9ances avec le kin\xE9sith\xE9rapeute Norberto Brude je n'ai plus de douleur, j'ai pu reprendre l'entra\xEEnement, je me r\xE9veillais avec la main endormie et cela ne s'est plus reproduit ! Un professionnel hors pair, et surtout il a su m'apporter du calme quand j'en avais le plus besoin.",language:"fr"}],pt:[{author:"Manu Covic",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT_z1Jocd8RtQKJjZNPHtT6nWADbK9htmMD0ZnLXcr5WYoZBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101062939083218654733/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto me ajudou muito e aliviou as dores nas costas e nos joelhos que eu vinha sentindo. Ele foi muito simp\xE1tico e profissional. Recomendo-o fortemente!",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 uma semana",publishTime:"2026-10-17T15:27:44.938806512Z"},{author:"Mail\xEDn Schneeberger",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7x83prghHbR_UiPIGfbc95mu8jcrTxPiT4RzDjyGFhI869U5DzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112780727533746305420/reviews",rating:5,text:"Estou muito satisfeita com o servi\xE7o. Norberto se destaca pelo profissionalismo, pontualidade e cordialidade. Ele contribuiu muito para a minha recupera\xE7\xE3o com um plano de tratamento personalizado. Recomendo-o fortemente se voc\xEA procura um especialista de confian\xE7a.",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 um m\xEAs",publishTime:"2026-09-05T09:51:49.661002767Z"},{author:"Mabel Luj\xE1n",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBfQZpjPw8LN5V7jT-CmJiCzsIWu7SIBXRqourAQTOJvmxQLse=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115447603217467401197/reviews",rating:5,text:"Uma profissional extremamente respons\xE1vel e respeitosa, com excelentes habilidades de escuta, o que \xE9 inestim\xE1vel nesta especialidade. O tratamento \xE9 muito personalizado, utilizando diversas t\xE9cnicas adaptadas \xE0s necessidades de cada paciente. Estou muito satisfeita!",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 um m\xEAs",publishTime:"2026-09-01T17:22:51.713761464Z"},{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Venho h\xE1 anos, e o atendimento do Norberto \xE9 excelente. Ele sabe escutar para definir em que pontos focar o trabalho e conhece diversas t\xE9cnicas que usa conforme a necessidade do paciente. Sempre sa\xED da consulta me sentindo melhor do que no in\xEDcio. Recomendo muit\xEDssimo!!!!!",language:"pt"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incrivelmente surpreso, para melhor: levei 3 anos com dor por epicondilite e, em apenas 2 sess\xF5es com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude, n\xE3o tenho mais dor, pude voltar a treinar, acordava com a m\xE3o dormente e isso n\xE3o voltou a acontecer! Sinceramente um profissional fora de s\xE9rie, e acima de tudo soube trazer calma quando mais eu precisava.",language:"pt"}]},translations:{"mariana gonzalez cadahia":{es:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",en:"I've been coming here for years, and Norberto's care is excellent. He knows how to listen so he can decide where to focus the work, and he uses a range of techniques according to the patient's needs. I always left feeling better than when I arrived. I recommend him highly!!!!!",fr:"Je viens le consulter depuis des ann\xE9es, et l'accompagnement de Norberto est excellent. Il sait \xE9couter pour d\xE9terminer sur quels points concentrer le travail, et il ma\xEEtrise diverses techniques qu'il utilise selon les besoins du patient. Je suis toujours sortie de la s\xE9ance mieux qu'\xE0 l'arriv\xE9e. Je le recommande vivement !!!!!",pt:"Venho h\xE1 anos, e o atendimento do Norberto \xE9 excelente. Ele sabe escutar para definir em que pontos focar o trabalho e conhece diversas t\xE9cnicas que usa conforme a necessidade do paciente. Sempre sa\xED da consulta me sentindo melhor do que no in\xEDcio. Recomendo muit\xEDssimo!!!!!"},"gabriel rotman":{es:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",en:"Incredibly surprised, in a good way: I had epicondylitis pain for 3 years, and after just 2 sessions with kinesiologist Norberto Brude I have no pain, I was able to go back to training, I used to wake up with a numb hand and it hasn't happened again! Truly an outstanding professional, and above all he brought calm when I needed it most.",fr:"Agr\xE9ablement surpris, au-del\xE0 de toute attente : je souffrais d'une \xE9picondylite depuis 3 ans, et en \xE0 peine 2 s\xE9ances avec le kin\xE9sith\xE9rapeute Norberto Brude je n'ai plus de douleur, j'ai pu reprendre l'entra\xEEnement, je me r\xE9veillais avec la main endormie et cela ne s'est plus reproduit ! Un professionnel hors pair, et surtout il a su m'apporter du calme quand j'en avais le plus besoin.",pt:"Incrivelmente surpreso, para melhor: levei 3 anos com dor por epicondilite e, em apenas 2 sess\xF5es com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude, n\xE3o tenho mais dor, pude voltar a treinar, acordava com a m\xE3o dormente e isso n\xE3o voltou a acontecer! Sinceramente um profissional fora de s\xE9rie, e acima de tudo soube trazer calma quando mais eu precisava."}}};
